### 2b. **The paint() Helper: SGR 256-Color Wrapping**

**File: `/home/gregz/cp/panopt/crates/panopt-zellij/src/main.rs`, lines 3161-3179:**
```rust
fn paint(content: &str, cols: usize, style: Style, fg: Option<u8>, focused: bool) -> String {
    let truncated: String = content.chars().take(cols).collect();
    let mut codes: Vec<String> = Vec::new();
    if focused {
        codes.push("7".to_string());  // inverse video
    }
    match style {
        Style::Dim => codes.push("2".to_string()),   // dim
        Style::Normal => {}
    }
    if let Some(c) = fg {
        codes.push(format!("38;5;{c}"));  // 256-color foreground
    }
    if codes.is_empty() {
        truncated
    } else {
        format!("\u{1b}[{}m{}\u{1b}[0m", codes.join(";"), truncated)
    }
}
```

**Signature:** `fn paint(content: &str, cols: usize, style: Style, fg: Option<u8>, focused: bool) -> String`

